<title>BRAZIL: Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</title>
<headline>Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santos port reported the following conditions for shipments of soybeans and soymeal on Monday:</p>
<p>Vessels: Tomis Future expected to dock to load 50,000 tonnes soybeans.</p>
<p>Trucks: 458 arrived Monday and unloaded 11,937 tonnes soybeans.</p>
<p>Stocks: 73,231 tonnes soybeans, 6,011 tonnes soymeal.</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417))</p>
</text>
